	"data": "Reflection: January 10, 2020 — \"Old and New\"\n\nPulled randomly from the 2020 folder. A 70-minute recording from a Friday evening, pre-pandemic. He was 22, in his room, eating cashews, trying to hit 12,600 steps, and doing something he doesn't do enough of anymore: talking to a recorder with no plan.\n\nWhat's Still Alive\n\nThe \"Who I Am\" document. Written September 2017, read aloud in January 2020, still recognizable in August 2026. The core self-portrait — extrovert who's shy, jack-of-all-trades…",
